@startuml User_Stories_RoleMatrix
title Role-Based Access Control (RBAC) & Permissions Matrix

' Define Role Hierarchy and Permissions
class Role {
    name: String
    level: Integer
}

class Admin extends Role {
    - Full system access
    - Can manage users
    - Can configure settings
    - Can view all data
    - Can generate reports
}

class Comptable extends Role {
    - Can view financial data
    - Can create/approve invoices
    - Can access financial documents
    - Limited to finance module
}

class Secretaire extends Role {
    - Can manage documents
    - Can schedule meetings
    - Can send communications
    - Limited to admin tasks
}

class Employee extends Role {
    - Can view own documents
    - Can view assigned tasks
    - Most restricted access
    - No admin features
}

' Permission Matrix as separate entities
class FeatureAccess {
    role: Role
    feature: String
    canCreate: Boolean
    canRead: Boolean
    canUpdate: Boolean
    canDelete: Boolean
}

' Features with permissions
note as AuthFeatures
  **Authentication Module:**
  - Register: Employee ✓, Admin ✓
  - Login: All ✓
  - Session Management: All ✓
  - RBAC: Admin ✓
end note

note as UserMgmtFeatures
  **User Management:**
  - Create Users: Admin ✓
  - Delete Users: Admin ✓
  - View Users: Admin ✓, Comptable ✓
  - Update Users: Admin ✓
  - Invite Users: Admin ✓
end note

note as DocFeatures
  **Document Management:**
  - Upload: Secretaire ✓, Comptable ✓, Employee ✓
  - View Own: All ✓
  - View Department: Comptable ✓, Secretaire ✓
  - View All: Admin ✓
  - Delete: Admin ✓
  - Share: All ✓
end note

note as AIFeatures
  **AI Chat Module:**
  - Access: All ✓
  - Rate Limits:
    • Admin: 20 req/min
    • Comptable: 10 req/min
    • Secretaire: 10 req/min
    • Employee: 5 req/min
end note

note as DashboardFeatures
  **Dashboard & Analytics:**
  - Personal Dashboard: All ✓
  - Department Analytics: Comptable ✓, Secretaire ✓
  - Enterprise Analytics: Admin ✓
  - Audit Logs: Admin ✓
  - Export Reports: Admin ✓, Comptable ✓
end note

note as EmailFeatures
  **Email System:**
  - Send Notifications: Admin ✓, Secretaire ✓
  - Send Invoices: Comptable ✓
  - Send Documents: All ✓ (own docs)
  - Email Templates: Admin ✓
end note

note as EnterpriseFeatures
  **Enterprise Management:**
  - Manage Enterprise: Admin ✓
  - Configure Settings: Admin ✓
  - Manage Subscription: Admin ✓
  - View Billing: Admin ✓, Comptable ✓
  - Multi-tenant Admin: Admin ✓
end note

' API Rate Limit Matrix
table RateLimitMatrix {
  | **Endpoint Type** | **Admin** | **Comptable** | **Secretaire** | **Employee** |
  |-
  | Standard API | 100/min | 60/min | 60/min | 30/min |
  | AI Chat | 20/min | 10/min | 10/min | 5/min |
  | Document API | 100/min | 80/min | 80/min | 40/min |
  | Analytics API | 50/min | 30/min | 30/min | 10/min |
}

' Data Access Rules
note as DataAccessRules
  **Data Isolation & Access:**
  
  Query Filter Applied at Service Layer:
  WHERE entreprise_id = current_user.entreprise_id
  AND (role_permissions check)
  
  Role-Based Filters:
  - Admin: No filter (all data)
  - Comptable: Financial data only
  - Secretaire: Admin/HR data only
  - Employee: Own data only
end note

' Security Constraints
note as SecurityConstraints
  **Security Constraints:**
  - Password: ≥8 chars, BCrypt hashed
  - JWT: exp 24h, refresh 7d
  - Session: Auto-logout after 1h inactivity
  - Terms: Cannot delete last Admin
  - Audit: All actions logged
  - Encryption: SSL/TLS in transit, AES at rest
end note

@enduml
